# HireAI 🚀
An AI-powered resume analysis and job matching web application built to streamline applicant screening and skill gap identification.

## Tech Stack
* **Backend:** Python, FastAPI, Uvicorn, PyPDF
* **Frontend:** Vanilla HTML, CSS, JavaScript (Responsive UI)

## Features
* Extracts and reads text directly from uploaded PDF resumes.
* Compares candidate skills against job descriptions using smart keyword matching.
* Calculates an instant match score percentage.
* Highlights matched vs. missing skills and generates tailored interview recommendations.